<?php $actionLabels=['CREATE'=>'Création','UPDATE'=>'Modification','DELETE'=>'Suppression','LOGIN'=>'Connexion','LOGOUT'=>'Déconnexion','CLOSE'=>'Clôture'];$actionIcons=['CREATE'=>'plus-circle','UPDATE'=>'pencil','DELETE'=>'trash3','LOGIN'=>'box-arrow-in-right','LOGOUT'=>'box-arrow-right','CLOSE'=>'lock']; ?>
<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="fr"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Journal d’audit - <?= APP_NAME ?></title><link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.css" rel="stylesheet"><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Outfit:wght@600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link href="<?= BASE_URL ?>/assets/css/dashboard.css" rel="stylesheet"><link href="<?= BASE_URL ?>/assets/css/users.css" rel="stylesheet"><link href="<?= BASE_URL ?>/assets/css/profile.css" rel="stylesheet"><link href="<?= BASE_URL ?>/assets/css/theme.css" rel="stylesheet"><link href="<?= BASE_URL ?>/assets/css/audit.css" rel="stylesheet"><script src="<?= BASE_URL ?>/assets/js/theme-mode.js"></script></head><body>
<div class="dashboard-shell"><div class="mobile-overlay" id="mobile-overlay" onclick="toggleSidebar()"></div><?php require dirname(__DIR__).'/layouts/sidebar.php'; ?><main class="dashboard-main"><header class="dashboard-topbar"><button class="menu-button" onclick="toggleSidebar()"><i class="bi bi-list"></i></button><div><h1>Journal d’audit</h1><p>Traçabilité des actions réalisées dans l’application</p></div><div class="topbar-date"><i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i> Administration</div></header><div class="users-content">
<section class="audit-stats"><article><i class="bi bi-activity"></i><span><strong><?= $stats['total']??0 ?></strong><small>Événements</small></span></article><article><i class="bi bi-people"></i><span><strong><?= $stats['utilisateurs']??0 ?></strong><small>Utilisateurs</small></span></article><article><i class="bi bi-plus-circle"></i><span><strong><?= $stats['creations']??0 ?></strong><small>Créations</small></span></article><article><i class="bi bi-pencil"></i><span><strong><?= $stats['modifications']??0 ?></strong><small>Modifications</small></span></article><article><i class="bi bi-trash3"></i><span><strong><?= $stats['suppressions']??0 ?></strong><small suppressions>Suppressions</small></span></article></section>
<form class="audit-filter" method="GET"><label>Du<input type="date" name="debut" value="<?= htmlspecialchars($filtres['debut']) ?>"></label><label>Au<input type="date" name="fin" value="<?= htmlspecialchars($filtres['fin']) ?>"></label><label>Action<select name="action"><option value="">Toutes</option><?php foreach($options['actions']as$a):?><option <?= $filtres['action']===$a?'selected':'' ?>><?= htmlspecialchars($a) ?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></label><label>Module<select name="table"><option value="">Tous</option><?php foreach($options['tables']as$t):?><option <?= $filtres['table']===$t?'selected':'' ?>><?= htmlspecialchars($t) ?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></label><label>Utilisateur<select name="utilisateur_id"><option value="0">Tous</option><?php foreach($options['utilisateurs']as$u):?><option value="<?= (int)$u['id'] ?>" <?= $filtres['utilisateur_id']===(int)$u['id']?'selected':'' ?>><?= htmlspecialchars($u['nom_utilisateur'].' — '.$u['matricule']) ?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></label><button><i class="bi bi-funnel"></i> Filtrer</button><a href="<?= BASE_URL ?>/audit"><i class="bi bi-arrow-counterclockwise"></i></a></form>
<section class="users-heading"><div><h2>Historique des activités</h2><p><?= count($journaux) ?> événement(s) pour la période sélectionnée.</p></div><label class="audit-search"><i class="bi bi-search"></i><input id="audit-search" type="search" placeholder="Utilisateur, action, module…" oninput="filterAudit()"></label></section>
<section class="users-table-card"><div class="users-table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Date et heure</th><th>Utilisateur</th><th>Action</th><th>Module</th><th>Enregistrement</th><th>Adresse IP</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id="audit-body"><?php if(!$journaux):?><tr><td colspan="7" class="users-empty"><i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i><strong>Aucune activité enregistrée</strong><span>Les futures actions journalisées apparaîtront ici.</span></td></tr><?php endif;?><?php foreach($journaux as$j):$json=htmlspecialchars(json_encode($j,JSON_UNESCAPED_UNICODE|JSON_UNESCAPED_SLASHES),ENT_QUOTES,'UTF-8');$search=strtolower($j['utilisateur'].' '.$j['matricule'].' '.$j['action'].' '.$j['table_concernee'].' '.$j['adresse_ip']);?><tr data-search="<?= htmlspecialchars($search) ?>"><td><strong><?= date('d/m/Y',strtotime($j['created_at'])) ?></strong><small><?= date('H:i:s',strtotime($j['created_at'])) ?></small></td><td><div class="identity"><span><?php if($j['profil']):?><img src="<?= BASE_URL.'/'.htmlspecialchars($j['profil']) ?>" alt=""><?php else:?><?= htmlspecialchars(strtoupper(substr($j['utilisateur'],0,2))) ?><?php endif;?></span><div><strong><?= htmlspecialchars($j['utilisateur']) ?></strong><small><?= htmlspecialchars($j['matricule']) ?></small></div></div></td><td><span class="audit-action action-<?= strtolower($j['action']) ?>"><i class="bi bi-<?= $actionIcons[$j['action']]??'activity' ?>"></i><?= htmlspecialchars($actionLabels[$j['action']]??$j['action']) ?></span></td><td><span class="audit-module"><?= htmlspecialchars($j['table_concernee']) ?></span></td><td><?= $j['enregistrement_id']?'#'.(int)$j['enregistrement_id']:'—' ?></td><td><?= htmlspecialchars($j['adresse_ip']?:'—') ?></td><td><button class="audit-detail" onclick="openAudit(<?= $json ?>)"><i class="bi bi-eye"></i></button></td></tr><?php endforeach;?></tbody></table></div></section>
</div><footer class="dashboard-footer">© <?= date('Y') ?> MWIRA Trans <span>Sécurité et traçabilité</span></footer></main></div>
<div class="users-modal-overlay" id="audit-modal"><div class="users-modal audit-modal"><div class="modal-title"><div><h3>Détail de l’événement</h3><p id="audit-reference"></p></div><button onclick="closeAudit()">&times;</button></div><div class="audit-meta" id="audit-meta"></div><div class="audit-values"><section><h4>Ancienne valeur</h4><pre id="audit-old"></pre></section><section><h4>Nouvelle valeur</h4><pre id="audit-new"></pre></section></div><div class="audit-agent"><strong>Navigateur / appareil</strong><p id="audit-agent"></p></div><div class="modal-buttons"><button type="button" class="cancel" onclick="closeAudit()">Fermer</button></div></div></div>
<script>function toggleSidebar(){document.getElementById('dashboard-sidebar').classList.toggle('open');document.getElementById('mobile-overlay').classList.toggle('show')}function filterAudit(){const q=document.getElementById('audit-search').value.toLowerCase().trim();document.querySelectorAll('#audit-body tr[data-search]').forEach(r=>r.style.display=!q||r.dataset.search.includes(q)?'':'none')}function pretty(v){if(!v)return'Aucune donnée';try{return JSON.stringify(JSON.parse(v),null,2)}catch(e){return v}}function openAudit(j){document.getElementById('audit-reference').textContent='#'+j.id+' · '+j.action+' · '+j.table_concernee;document.getElementById('audit-meta').innerHTML=`<span><small>Utilisateur</small><strong>${escapeHtml(j.utilisateur)}</strong></span><span><small>Date</small><strong>${new Date(j.created_at.replace(' ','T')).toLocaleString('fr-FR')}</strong></span><span><small>Adresse IP</small><strong>${escapeHtml(j.adresse_ip||'—')}</strong></span>`;document.getElementById('audit-old').textContent=pretty(j.ancienne_valeur);document.getElementById('audit-new').textContent=pretty(j.nouvelle_valeur);document.getElementById('audit-agent').textContent=j.user_agent||'Non renseigné';document.getElementById('audit-modal').classList.add('show')}function closeAudit(){document.getElementById('audit-modal').classList.remove('show')}function escapeHtml(v){const d=document.createElement('div');d.textContent=v;return d.innerHTML}</script></body></html>
